Singularity is an end-game mechanic unlocked by Refine Node 121. 

=== Overview ===
Upon unlocking, you may perform your first Singularity, which will reset the following:

* Minerals (except the Refine Tree)
* Elements
* Tarot (except Tarot Challenges)
* Artifacts
* Plague
* Your current Atom count

After your first Singularity, you will need 1.8e308 Atoms to perform a Singularity again.

==== Atoms ====
Singularity is centered around Atoms, which multiply themselves every second based on your Singularity Multiplier. This multiplier is increased when performing a Singularity, based on all of your Singularity Mult factors.

== Buffs & Penalties ==
At various atom thresholds you will gain a buff or penalty. These buffs/penalties are only applied if your current atom count is at or above the threshold. Many of these buffs/penalties can be modified via the Mineral and Singularity refine tree nodes, as well as Relic 69. You can view your current buffs/penalties in the lower, right-hand corner of the main Singularity tab.
