== Tree ==
[[File:Screenshot 2026-08-11 103117.png|thumb|The Singularity Tree]]
Unlocked at 5 Singularities. Each individual tree node can be levelled up multiple times, up to level 10, and you must purchase at least one level in the previous node in order to unlock and buy the next node. Once a node reaches level 10 you can choose to "Ascend" it which resets its level but keeps the effect bonus and resets the initial level upgrade cost. After ascending, the upgrade costs increase at a higher rate for each level and give less bonus per level. Unlike buying RfP nodes, when purchasing a Singularity tree node upgrade it divides your atom count rather than subtracting from it. 
