== Houses ==
[[File:Screenshot 2026-08-11 103128.png|thumb|The Houses tab]]
Unlocked at 32 Singularities. An advanced version of Astrology; you get a Singular Zodiac when Singularizing with 1e1000 Atoms or more. Zodiacs must be placed in their matching House on the circle. Each spot is numbered with roman numerals, starting with I at the west, and moving counter-clockwise. A second effect is unlocked at the Divine rarity, and a third is unlocked at Rainbow rarity (inaccessible as of writing). Each Singular Zodiac also has a level just like Common Zodiacs, and this level is based on the two Singular Zodiac Level multipliers from Singularity Mult and Count, which multiplied together gives your expected level.
